From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Philip Balister <philip@balister.org>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 10:06:45 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] test: list the gtest cases at test time in a cross build

gtest_discover_tests() runs each test program after it is built to
list its cases (DISCOVERY_MODE POST_BUILD). In a cross build without
CMAKE_CROSSCOMPILING_EMULATOR the build machine can't run the target's
programs, so building the tests fails.

There, default CMAKE_GTEST_DISCOVER_TESTS_DISCOVERY_MODE to PRE_TEST,
which leaves the listing to ctest on the machine that runs the tests.
A build with an emulator, or one that sets the mode itself, is
unchanged.

Upstream-Status: Submitted [https://github.com/gnuradio/gnuradio4-control-plane/pull/58]

Signed-off-by: Philip Balister <philip@balister.org>
---
 CMakeLists.txt | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
index 9ab8fd9..0b6e4e9 100644
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -374,6 +374,11 @@ if(NOT EMSCRIPTEN)
     add_dependencies(gr4cp_smoke_test gr4cp_server)
 
     include(GoogleTest)
+    # gtest_discover_tests() runs each test program after it is built to list its cases. A cross build can't run the
+    # target's programs unless it has an emulator, so leave the listing to ctest, which runs where the tests do.
+    if(CMAKE_CROSSCOMPILING AND NOT CMAKE_CROSSCOMPILING_EMULATOR AND NOT DEFINED CMAKE_GTEST_DISCOVER_TESTS_DISCOVERY_MODE)
+        set(CMAKE_GTEST_DISCOVER_TESTS_DISCOVERY_MODE PRE_TEST)
+    endif()
     gtest_discover_tests(gr4cp_smoke_test
         PROPERTIES
             ENVIRONMENT "GR4CP_SERVER_EXECUTABLE=$<TARGET_FILE:gr4cp_server>"
-- 
